---
import Telemetry from '../components/Telemetry.astro';import {site} from '../site.config';import '../styles/global.css';
const{title,description=site.description,jsonld=[],crumbs=[],path,ogImage='/og/home.png',ogType='website',published,updated,noindex=false,pageType}=Astro.props;
const fullTitle=title.endsWith(site.name)?title:`${title} | ${site.name}`;
const canonical=new URL(path??Astro.url.pathname,site.url).href;
const ogAbs=new URL(ogImage,site.url).href;
const orgLd={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Organization','@id':`${site.url}/#organization`,name:site.name,alternateName:site.nameEn,url:site.url,description:site.description,email:site.contactEmail,logo:`${site.url}/og/home.png`};
const webLd={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'WebSite','@id':`${site.url}/#website`,name:site.name,alternateName:site.nameEn,url:site.url+'/',inLanguage:'ko-KR',description:site.description,publisher:{'@id':`${site.url}/#organization`}};
const pageLd={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':pageType??(ogType==='article'?'WebPage':(canonical===site.url+'/'?'WebPage':'CollectionPage')),'@id':canonical+'#webpage',url:canonical,name:fullTitle,description,inLanguage:'ko-KR',isPartOf:{'@id':`${site.url}/#website`},...(updated?{dateModified:updated}:{}),...(published?{datePublished:published}:{})};
const j=(o:unknown)=>JSON.stringify(o).replace(/</g,'\\u003c');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>{fullTitle}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><meta name="robots" content={noindex?'noindex, follow':'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1'}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title={`${site.name} RSS`} href={site.url+'/rss.xml'}/><link rel="sitemap" type="application/xml" href={site.url+'/sitemap-index.xml'}/><meta property="og:site_name" content={site.name}/><meta property="og:locale" content={site.locale}/><meta property="og:type" content={ogType}/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:image" content={ogAbs}/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/>{ogType==="article"&&published&&<meta property="article:published_time" content={published}/>}{ogType==="article"&&updated&&<meta property="article:modified_time" content={updated}/>}<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content={title}/><meta name="twitter:description" content={description}/><meta name="twitter:image" content={ogAbs}/><meta name="google-adsense-account" content={site.adsenseClient}/>{site.gscVerification&&<meta name="google-site-verification" content={site.gscVerification}/>} {site.naverVerification&&<meta name="naver-site-verification" content={site.naverVerification}/>}<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={j(orgLd)}/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={j(webLd)}/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={j(pageLd)}/>{jsonld.map((ld:unknown)=><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={j(ld)}/>)}{crumbs.length>0&&<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={j({'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'BreadcrumbList',itemListElement:crumbs.map((c:{name:string,href:string},i:number)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:i+1,name:c.name,item:new URL(c.href,site.url).href}))})}/>}<Telemetry/></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">본문으로 이동</a><header><a class="brand" href="/">거실상영관<small>WHERE ON OTT / HOME CINEMA NOTES</small></a><nav><a href="/guides/">상영 준비</a><a href="/picks/">상품 노트</a><a href="/methodology/">편집 기준</a><a href="/about/">소개</a></nav></header><main id="main"><slot/></main><footer><strong>상영이 끝나도, 선택의 기준은 남도록.</strong><p>거실상영관 (WhereOnOTT · whereonott.online): OTT 서비스 안내가 아닌 홈시네마 장비 구매 가이드입니다.</p><p>상영 준비 가이드에는 제휴 링크가 없습니다. 상품 노트(제휴 글)는 글 맨 위와 링크 옆에 수수료 관계를 표시합니다.</p><nav>{['about','methodology','contact','privacy','terms','disclaimer'].map((s,i)=><a href={'/'+s+'/'}>{['소개','방법론','문의','개인정보','약관','면책'][i]}</a>)} <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></nav></footer></body></html>
